# Benchmark archive index

BENCHMARKS.md is the living summary: accepted results, retained gates, material NO-GO decisions, commands.
This folder holds the evidence behind it; maintained workloads are in `benchmarks/`. Nothing in the source tree, the tests or CI reads these files; they are
read by people (and linked from BENCHMARKS.md and README.md). Some raw JSON, reference vectors and source copies were
recorded under the ignored `bench-results/` folder of the measuring machine; an ignored path is not a promise that a
file exists in a fresh checkout, and the tracked tables and commands stay here.

## Never edit: the pre-consolidation BENCHMARKS.md

01-04 preserve every line of the 5,752-line BENCHMARKS.md as it stood before the 2026-10-15 consolidation. In
filename order their bytewise concatenation has SHA-256
`6cf53334a6d2e46d66d60f4203607023e35320cc274ad9a456b58a23fb8f90d0`. Section numbers, fixed gates, failed
experiments and commands are unrewritten; later measurements may supersede an early number.

| File | Original sections | Content |
|---|---|---|
| [01-gpu-foundations.log](01-gpu-foundations.log) | 1-21 | GPU kernels, attention, quantization, KV, snapshots, first CPU audit. |
| [02-cpu-stages.log](02-cpu-stages.log) | 22-31 | SIMD and threads, CPU INT8, growable KV, INT4 pilot, loading and consolidation audits. |
| [03-loader-qwen35-planner.log](03-loader-qwen35-planner.log) | 32-40 | Packed loader, Qwen3.5-2B/4B execution, CUDA, static V9 planner. |
| [04-granite-moe.log](04-granite-moe.log) | 41-46 | Granite 3.0 CPU/CUDA, strict parity NO-GOs, H-Tiny pilot. |

