## Harnesses and raw outputs (not tracked)

The one-off drivers, Rust probes (`*.rs.txt`), summarizers, prompt sets, transcripts and per-run outputs behind these logs
(`06-load.py`, `11-code-eval.py`, `15-checkpoint-e2e.sh`, `17-` to `21-harness/`, ...) are no longer tracked; this folder keeps only
the logs. They stay on the maintainer's machine and in git history: the last commit that contains them is `5a4a8ee`
(`git show 5a4a8ee:docs/benchmarks/archive/<path>`). Maintained workloads live in `benchmarks/`
(`server_load.py` replaces `06-load.py`). New harnesses are not committed unless they are worth rerunning.
